invalid type: string "Investigation Stage: Medical & Inquest Procedure\nCrime Category: violent_crimes\nAction Required: Arrange immediate medical examination of victim or conduct formal inquest inquiry under BNSS Section 194/196.\nPurpose: Obtain medico-legal certificate (MLC) or post-mortem report specifying exact cause of injury or death.\ns, and trace DNA.\nmo, Section 63 BSHA certificate.ÿÿÿÿ